WEBVTT

00:05.797 --> 00:07.924
[theme music playing]

00:15.306 --> 00:16.850
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS

00:22.647 --> 00:24.649
[suspenseful music playing]

00:58.850 --> 00:59.684
[clang]

01:15.116 --> 01:16.326
[growling]

01:38.598 --> 01:40.016
[Beom-pal whimpers]

01:41.059 --> 01:42.519
[stomping]

01:45.855 --> 01:47.440
[sobbing]

01:49.400 --> 01:51.027
[stomping continues]

01:54.114 --> 01:55.907
[panting]

01:57.742 --> 01:59.619
- [munching]
- [screaming]

02:02.539 --> 02:04.124
[munching]

02:12.632 --> 02:14.259
[whimpering]

02:14.342 --> 02:15.510
[creature snarling]

02:22.517 --> 02:24.769
- [screaming]
- [snarling]

02:24.853 --> 02:26.187
[screaming continues]

02:40.118 --> 02:41.202
[clamoring]

02:42.996 --> 02:44.497
- [munches]
- [screaming]

02:48.251 --> 02:50.253
My lord! I am stuck!

02:52.005 --> 02:53.298
[snarling]

02:54.841 --> 02:57.177
[screaming]

02:58.344 --> 03:00.180
[whimpering]

03:04.809 --> 03:05.935
[soldier] My lord!

03:06.019 --> 03:07.520
[whimpering]

03:07.604 --> 03:09.355
[snarling]

03:11.900 --> 03:13.943
[screaming]

03:16.863 --> 03:19.032
[growling]

03:19.115 --> 03:21.117
[screaming]

03:24.412 --> 03:25.830
[munching]

03:26.539 --> 03:28.166
[snarling]

03:28.249 --> 03:29.918
[whimpering]

03:35.465 --> 03:36.841
[clanking]

03:37.884 --> 03:39.344
[Beom-pal] Hurry up!

03:39.427 --> 03:41.429
Shit! Hurry up!

03:42.639 --> 03:43.806
What are you doing?

03:43.890 --> 03:46.017
- Open it already!
- [whimpering]

03:46.100 --> 03:47.352
[screaming]

03:47.435 --> 03:48.269
Hurry!

03:48.686 --> 03:51.064
Hurry up! Shit!

03:52.690 --> 03:53.858
[screaming]

03:54.734 --> 03:57.862
- Hurry! Come on!
- [whimpering]

04:05.453 --> 04:07.038
[clamoring]

04:11.376 --> 04:12.502
[whimpers]

04:12.585 --> 04:15.213
The key! Where is the key?

04:15.797 --> 04:16.839
[screams]

04:16.923 --> 04:17.799
There is no door!

04:17.882 --> 04:20.301
The key! Bring me the key!

04:20.385 --> 04:23.388
Open it! Open it! Now!

04:24.597 --> 04:25.974
[growling]

04:27.892 --> 04:29.227
[Beom-pal] Open it!

04:29.727 --> 04:31.813
Lock it! Now!

04:31.896 --> 04:33.940
Hurry up! Lock it!

04:35.108 --> 04:36.276
- [chomps]
- [screams]

04:37.277 --> 04:39.195
- [yells]
- [gasps]

04:40.196 --> 04:42.031
- [grunting]
- [screaming]

04:43.491 --> 04:44.409
[groans]

04:44.909 --> 04:47.328
- [bones cracking]
- [grunts]

04:49.998 --> 04:51.916
[screaming]

04:52.750 --> 04:54.168
[growling]

04:55.336 --> 04:56.671
[screaming]

05:01.551 --> 05:03.803
[Beom-pal whimpering]

05:03.886 --> 05:05.763
No! Do not go there!

05:07.890 --> 05:09.517
[growling]

05:09.600 --> 05:11.227
[screaming]

05:11.311 --> 05:12.603
[screeching]

05:15.815 --> 05:17.525
[Beom-pal whimpering]

05:23.448 --> 05:24.449
[thud]

05:27.952 --> 05:29.746
[creatures snarling]

05:32.373 --> 05:34.375
[growling]

05:40.798 --> 05:42.717
Please, help. Help!

05:47.138 --> 05:49.390
No! Stop!

05:49.474 --> 05:51.309
No! Do not come any closer!

05:51.392 --> 05:52.643
[screaming]

05:52.727 --> 05:54.145
[snarling]

06:00.443 --> 06:02.278
[suspenseful music playing]

06:05.823 --> 06:07.241
[snarling]

06:12.872 --> 06:14.874
[crying]

06:16.376 --> 06:18.503
Come here. Come.

06:20.129 --> 06:21.964
- [grunts]
- [crying]

06:26.260 --> 06:27.720
[rattling]

06:30.890 --> 06:31.808
Here.

06:33.309 --> 06:35.436
[woman] Help!

06:36.270 --> 06:37.480
- Open the door! Now!
- Help!

06:37.563 --> 06:39.607
- Someone is out there.
- [woman] Help me!

06:40.525 --> 06:42.777
- Come this way!
- [woman] Hurry!

06:43.277 --> 06:44.904
[grunting] The door is locked.

06:46.197 --> 06:47.281
This way!

06:50.284 --> 06:51.202
[grunting]

06:52.662 --> 06:53.788
[snarling]

06:55.957 --> 06:56.874
Come on!

06:59.710 --> 07:01.629
- [baby crying]
- [clamoring]

07:01.712 --> 07:03.131
[growling]

07:03.756 --> 07:05.007
[man] Let go of her!

07:05.591 --> 07:07.718
[woman screaming] Oh, no!

07:09.554 --> 07:12.265
- [woman 2] She got bitten!
- [man 2] Let go! Let go of her hand!

07:12.348 --> 07:15.309
What are you doing?
She was already bitten!

07:16.310 --> 07:19.355
Grab the baby. Hurry!

07:20.481 --> 07:21.691
[man 3] Let go of her!

07:23.651 --> 07:25.528
Let go! She was bitten!

07:30.116 --> 07:31.284
[man 3] Let go of her!

07:32.160 --> 07:33.911
[sobbing] Please, help me!

07:35.079 --> 07:36.706
[whimpering]

07:40.251 --> 07:42.462
[screaming]

07:43.045 --> 07:44.755
[snarling, munching]

07:53.264 --> 07:55.099
[growling]

08:01.898 --> 08:03.733
[growling]

08:07.445 --> 08:09.280
[screaming]

08:16.954 --> 08:18.539
[horse neighing]

08:19.499 --> 08:21.417
[horse neighing]

08:22.043 --> 08:23.753
[snarling]

08:23.836 --> 08:24.962
[screaming]

08:25.046 --> 08:27.340
[screaming]

08:27.423 --> 08:28.716
Hyah! Hyah!

08:32.970 --> 08:34.722
[clamoring]

08:35.515 --> 08:37.308
[snarling]

08:39.894 --> 08:43.105
These peasants are attacking noblemen!

08:48.986 --> 08:50.530
Shut the gate! Shut it now!

08:57.411 --> 08:58.287
Shit!

08:58.371 --> 09:00.414
- [growling]
- [screaming]

09:11.926 --> 09:14.512
[fisherman] Wow. These look great.

09:15.388 --> 09:17.640
- It is so heavy.
- [head clerk] Hurry!

09:17.723 --> 09:19.141
[fisherman] What's going on?

09:19.225 --> 09:20.351
[head clerk] Run!

09:25.314 --> 09:26.941
[fisherman] Hey! Park!

09:27.024 --> 09:28.109
[giggles]

09:28.192 --> 09:30.236
We caught fish! Come here!

09:30.319 --> 09:31.404
Is that him?

09:31.821 --> 09:34.073
[fisherman] It is obviously him.

09:34.156 --> 09:35.491
[fisherman 2] My gosh.

09:36.033 --> 09:37.910
He must have drunk a lot today.

09:38.661 --> 09:40.621
Hey! Are you drunk?

09:41.247 --> 09:44.208
- [fisherman 1] Who are those people?
- [fisherman 2] My gosh.

09:44.292 --> 09:45.418
Hey, hey, hey.

09:45.918 --> 09:47.795
[fisherman 2 gasps] What is going on?

09:48.337 --> 09:49.839
- Hey.
- What is wrong with them?

09:49.922 --> 09:52.300
- [fisherman 3] Hey! What is that?
- [growling]

09:54.260 --> 09:56.095
[fishermen screaming]

09:59.599 --> 10:02.602
- [children wailing]
- [Kim] Stop running. You will get hungry.

10:03.436 --> 10:05.313
- Stop fighting. Don't bite him!
- [child screams]

10:05.396 --> 10:06.981
[Kim] That will scar!

10:07.064 --> 10:08.899
- Let go!
- You punk.

10:08.983 --> 10:10.651
- I said, that will scar.
- [child] Let go!

10:13.029 --> 10:14.030
[child] Get off me!

10:14.113 --> 10:16.282
- [child screams]
- [snarls]

10:17.033 --> 10:17.867
[gasps]

10:17.950 --> 10:19.285
[clamoring]

10:33.966 --> 10:35.509
Father. Father!

10:36.010 --> 10:37.803
[grunts, screams]

10:38.554 --> 10:39.764
What is wrong?

10:40.514 --> 10:41.849
[retching]

10:47.855 --> 10:49.190
[whimpering]

10:52.276 --> 10:54.195
[whimpering]

10:55.071 --> 10:58.199
- [snarling]
- [whimpers, screams]

11:03.496 --> 11:06.916
Deok-i, stay here.
I will go look for your sister.

11:08.584 --> 11:09.627
Do not come out.

11:12.254 --> 11:13.381
[groans]

11:14.799 --> 11:15.800
[mother grunts]

11:20.805 --> 11:21.764
[moans]

11:28.521 --> 11:30.272
[snarling]

11:41.701 --> 11:43.327
[approaching footsteps]

11:45.121 --> 11:46.080
[girl] Mommy!

11:48.290 --> 11:49.750
What is wrong with you?

11:50.918 --> 11:52.795
- [groans]
- You are scaring me!

11:53.796 --> 11:56.132
Stop it, Mommy! Stop it!

11:56.215 --> 11:57.383
[growls]

11:57.466 --> 11:59.468
[girl screaming]

12:06.726 --> 12:09.061
[breathing heavily]

12:11.939 --> 12:13.607
[creature snarling]

12:20.364 --> 12:21.574
[snarling]

12:23.409 --> 12:25.202
[growling]

12:32.585 --> 12:34.336
[clamoring]

12:43.471 --> 12:44.638
[inhales sharply]

12:51.312 --> 12:52.730
[panting]

13:01.322 --> 13:03.783
[panting]

13:12.124 --> 13:13.000
[grunts]

13:17.588 --> 13:18.839
[growling]

13:21.383 --> 13:22.426
[thwack]

13:28.974 --> 13:30.184
Your Royal Highness!

13:42.112 --> 13:43.239
Your Royal Highness!

13:51.789 --> 13:53.207
[snarling]

13:56.919 --> 13:58.254
Your Royal Highness, run!

14:00.923 --> 14:02.007
[snarling]

14:03.133 --> 14:04.176
[horse whinnying]

14:04.260 --> 14:05.344
Hold on tight!

14:07.513 --> 14:08.722
[horse neighs]

14:09.974 --> 14:10.975
[grunts]

14:13.269 --> 14:14.270
[screaming]

14:17.815 --> 14:19.191
[yelling]

14:26.657 --> 14:27.950
[snarls]

14:28.033 --> 14:29.577
[screaming]

14:30.870 --> 14:32.496
[panting]

14:32.580 --> 14:34.498
[snarling]

14:38.836 --> 14:40.671
[panting]

14:40.754 --> 14:43.215
You must aim for their heads.

14:43.716 --> 14:46.135
Your Royal Highness! The barracks.

14:46.677 --> 14:48.387
[grunts] You must go to the barracks.

14:49.847 --> 14:51.348
[snarling]

14:52.558 --> 14:54.768
[suspenseful music playing]

14:54.852 --> 14:56.604
[crowd screaming]

14:58.522 --> 15:00.608
We must hurry, Your Royal Highness.

15:01.817 --> 15:02.735
Your Royal Highness!

15:11.243 --> 15:13.162
[man] Is anyone inside?

15:14.079 --> 15:15.623
Please let us in!

15:19.001 --> 15:20.085
Is anyone inside?

15:20.544 --> 15:21.503
Is anyone there?

15:24.006 --> 15:26.508
- Monsters are chasing us!
- I do not think anyone is here.

15:31.388 --> 15:32.389
Your Royal Highness.

15:35.059 --> 15:36.226
Please climb up.

15:37.227 --> 15:40.689
Excuse us. I am sorry,
but please step aside!

15:40.773 --> 15:41.732
Step aside!

15:41.815 --> 15:42.650
[grunts]

15:42.733 --> 15:44.360
[indistinct chatter]

15:47.947 --> 15:50.658
- We should climb over the wall.
- Let us climb over the wall!

15:55.788 --> 15:56.622
[grunts]

15:59.541 --> 16:01.335
[rumbling]

16:03.712 --> 16:05.839
Get off the fence at once!

16:07.508 --> 16:08.926
[man 2] Someone is inside!

16:09.426 --> 16:10.803
Get rid of them.

16:11.303 --> 16:12.471
Shoo them away. Now!

16:15.975 --> 16:17.768
- [Mu-yeong] Do not shoot!
- Get rid of them.

16:19.144 --> 16:20.104
[clamoring]

16:20.187 --> 16:21.188
Your Royal Highness!

16:21.772 --> 16:22.982
Are you all right?

16:24.108 --> 16:25.067
How dare you?

16:25.150 --> 16:27.236
He is the Crown Prince of this nation!

16:27.319 --> 16:28.153
Open the gate!

16:29.196 --> 16:30.531
[woman] Please, let us in.

16:30.614 --> 16:32.199
Do not try to fool me!

16:32.700 --> 16:35.369
Do not give me your nonsense, and scram!
All of you!

16:35.452 --> 16:40.541
Anyone who climbs over this wall
shall be punished by the law!

16:40.624 --> 16:43.460
- Let us climb up! Come on!
- Let us climb up, too!

16:43.544 --> 16:45.921
[head clerk] How dare you?
What do you think you are doing?

16:47.172 --> 16:48.257
[rumbling]

16:51.885 --> 16:53.053
Why those...

16:53.137 --> 16:55.222
Get down! Down!

16:55.305 --> 16:58.434
- [woman 2] At least let the children in!
- Did you not hear me? Push them off!

17:01.270 --> 17:02.229
- Go down!
- Scram!

17:02.688 --> 17:04.565
- Get away!
- Go down!

17:04.648 --> 17:06.525
- Go down!
- I said, scram!

17:06.608 --> 17:07.860
Get down!

17:08.277 --> 17:09.945
[soldier] Do not come up here!

17:10.029 --> 17:11.822
Shoot! Shoot the arrows!

17:16.285 --> 17:17.786
How dare you?

17:17.870 --> 17:19.913
If you get any closer,

17:20.497 --> 17:23.083
these arrows will pierce your bodies!

17:23.542 --> 17:26.170
[woman 3] Please help us!
Please do not leave us here to die!

17:26.253 --> 17:27.963
[creatures snarling]

17:28.839 --> 17:30.841
[suspenseful music playing]

17:36.889 --> 17:38.098
What the...

17:40.559 --> 17:42.144
[snarling]

17:42.227 --> 17:44.021
Your Royal Highness, you must go.

17:44.438 --> 17:47.066
Run! Everyone, run!

17:47.858 --> 17:48.901
Run!

17:59.244 --> 18:01.246
[woman 4 screaming]

18:08.378 --> 18:10.339
[panting]

18:11.465 --> 18:12.591
[man screaming]

18:18.430 --> 18:19.848
[Mu-yeong shouting]

18:21.225 --> 18:22.601
[Chang yelling]

18:32.569 --> 18:34.321
[ominous music playing]

18:44.248 --> 18:45.666
[growling]

18:58.095 --> 18:59.179
[Mu-yeong grunts]

19:01.640 --> 19:02.599
[Chang grunts]

19:05.519 --> 19:07.521
[both panting]

19:29.251 --> 19:30.252
Your Royal Highness.

19:33.046 --> 19:37.176
That female physician spoke the truth.
How could this happen?

19:49.897 --> 19:51.732
[munching]

20:04.995 --> 20:08.790
The baby within you
will be the King of this nation,

20:09.208 --> 20:10.626
so watch carefully.

20:12.169 --> 20:16.673
You must teach him
what happens to a powerless king.

20:17.132 --> 20:18.508
[king growls]

20:20.636 --> 20:22.804
Until the new Crown Prince is born,

20:24.389 --> 20:28.769
you must make sure His Majesty
has plenty to eat and drink.

20:48.205 --> 20:49.915
[snarling]

21:06.473 --> 21:07.557
[snarls]

21:30.372 --> 21:31.498
[child] Mommy.

21:39.298 --> 21:40.966
[snarling]

21:56.565 --> 21:57.899
[whimpering]

21:58.567 --> 22:01.403
Stop! Just stop already!

22:02.154 --> 22:03.363
[yells]

22:04.197 --> 22:05.365
Shit! I am exhausted.

22:06.658 --> 22:08.535
[creature growling]

22:27.721 --> 22:29.890
[whimpering]

22:41.151 --> 22:42.861
[grunting]

22:55.248 --> 22:57.459
[whimpering]

23:41.086 --> 23:42.212
My clothes got dirty.

23:42.295 --> 23:44.089
I shall prepare fresh clothes.

23:52.639 --> 23:53.849
[metal rattling]

23:58.812 --> 24:00.313
Go for a walk.

24:08.238 --> 24:10.240
[ominous music playing]

24:20.959 --> 24:21.918
[sighs]

25:18.517 --> 25:19.976
[clanging]

25:22.437 --> 25:24.231
Come down.

25:55.053 --> 25:56.012
[gasps]

26:04.563 --> 26:05.522
[whimpers]

26:18.368 --> 26:19.995
- My... My lord!
- What?

26:21.371 --> 26:23.123
My gosh!

26:23.206 --> 26:24.291
Why you...

26:24.374 --> 26:27.168
Oh, my. My lord. [sobbing]

26:27.252 --> 26:28.169
My lord.

26:29.004 --> 26:31.131
Thank goodness you are safe.

26:31.214 --> 26:32.924
Where were you until now?

26:33.842 --> 26:35.093
I was...

26:35.176 --> 26:36.845
I wanted to save you,

26:37.262 --> 26:40.974
so I brought all those soldiers.

26:41.057 --> 26:44.436
Save me? Now?
Do you know what I have gone through?

26:44.519 --> 26:46.980
I would have died last night
if not for her!

26:50.025 --> 26:50.942
Well...

26:52.402 --> 26:53.236
That jerk!

26:54.154 --> 26:56.114
It was all that jerk's fault!

26:56.197 --> 26:57.490
- What?
- What are you doing?

26:57.574 --> 26:58.533
Capture him now!

26:58.617 --> 26:59.492
Yes, my lord.

27:04.914 --> 27:07.417
It was... It was all his fault.

27:07.500 --> 27:11.880
He... He knew
all about those hideous things,

27:12.589 --> 27:14.049
but he hid it from us.

27:14.591 --> 27:15.842
I told you, did I not?

27:16.718 --> 27:18.094
That they were not dead.

27:18.178 --> 27:20.680
How dare you glare at me like that?
I shall...

27:20.764 --> 27:22.557
He is correct! Tell us now!

27:23.058 --> 27:25.935
What are those monsters?
Where did they come from?

27:26.645 --> 27:27.479
I...

27:28.104 --> 27:29.648
I will tell you.

27:29.731 --> 27:33.360
They were the ill at Jiyulheon
and their families.

27:33.443 --> 27:35.654
They could not withstand
starvation any longer

27:36.112 --> 27:37.530
and ate a human corpse, then...

27:37.614 --> 27:39.157
- What?
- ...they became monsters

27:39.240 --> 27:42.035
that crave human flesh and blood at night.

27:42.118 --> 27:44.496
During the day, they hide
where the sun does not reach

27:44.996 --> 27:47.165
and sleep as if they were dead.

27:47.248 --> 27:50.835
[stuttering] Human corpse... What...

27:50.919 --> 27:52.420
How could they do that?

27:53.129 --> 27:54.047
If that is true,

27:54.964 --> 27:57.342
why did you leave those corpses like that?

27:57.425 --> 27:59.010
You should have buried them

27:59.094 --> 28:01.429
when they were asleep
or gotten rid of them somehow!

28:02.764 --> 28:05.433
My lord, you must punish them
for their crimes.

28:05.517 --> 28:07.477
I am fine with being punished
for my crime,

28:07.977 --> 28:10.522
but is it not more urgent
to get rid of the bodies?

28:10.605 --> 28:13.149
When the sun sets,
more monsters will come.

28:13.233 --> 28:14.567
Then bury them quickly!

28:14.651 --> 28:15.610
Even if you bury them...

28:15.694 --> 28:17.070
- Yes--
- ...they will climb back out.

28:17.153 --> 28:19.030
You must cut off their heads or burn them.

28:19.114 --> 28:20.448
[exhales sharply]

28:21.533 --> 28:22.742
[woman] Burn the bodies?

28:22.826 --> 28:23.910
What?

28:23.993 --> 28:26.162
Who says you can burn the bodies?

28:27.080 --> 28:27.997
Oh...

28:29.040 --> 28:30.125
- Who...
- Well...

28:30.542 --> 28:34.045
She is the former commander's mother.

28:34.129 --> 28:35.547
Oh...

28:36.673 --> 28:38.967
You must never desecrate the body
you got from your parents.

28:39.050 --> 28:42.053
My precious son is our family's only son
for three generations.

28:42.137 --> 28:44.472
If you so much as lay a finger
on his body,

28:44.556 --> 28:46.182
you will have to answer to me!

28:46.266 --> 28:47.976
[man] If you lay a finger on the bodies

28:48.059 --> 28:50.645
of my family,
you will have to answer to me too!

28:50.729 --> 28:51.855
- But...
- [sighs]

28:54.274 --> 28:57.736
- Well, they are correct.
- What?

28:57.819 --> 29:01.072
With noblemen, even if they commit
grave crimes like murder,

29:01.156 --> 29:04.534
you cannot punish them
without the Royal Court's consent.

29:04.617 --> 29:05.785
You know that, right?

29:05.869 --> 29:07.871
- But...
- On top of that,

29:09.080 --> 29:11.082
if we burn all those bodies,

29:11.166 --> 29:13.543
we will face an angry backlash
from the upper class.

29:13.626 --> 29:15.295
Then what do I do?

29:15.378 --> 29:16.796
My gosh.

29:20.300 --> 29:21.217
- Right!
- Huh?

29:21.301 --> 29:24.471
- We should burn the peasants' bodies...
- Okay.

29:25.013 --> 29:29.058
...and hold proper funerals
for the bodies of the aristocrats.

29:29.142 --> 29:31.186
Then we should bury them

29:31.644 --> 29:34.481
deep into the ground. How about that?

29:34.564 --> 29:37.734
There are so many of them. How can we
differentiate nobles from peasants?

29:38.318 --> 29:40.737
Goodness. We can separate

29:40.820 --> 29:44.073
the bodies in silk from those in rags.

29:46.409 --> 29:48.244
- Great idea.
- Thank you.

29:48.328 --> 29:49.996
Split them into two groups!

29:50.079 --> 29:51.372
- Go on.
- Go.

29:52.665 --> 29:54.918
How is someone responsible
for the safety of the people

29:55.585 --> 29:56.878
this incompetent?

29:58.922 --> 30:00.882
- [crowd gasps]
- [Beom-pal] What are you doing?

30:00.965 --> 30:03.176
[swords rasping]

30:04.010 --> 30:06.638
The instant you draw your sword,
you shall lose your head!

30:10.225 --> 30:13.019
Who are you that you dare do this?

30:13.102 --> 30:14.521
You are not only incompetent

30:15.021 --> 30:16.481
but also endlessly vile.

30:17.398 --> 30:19.609
Because you locked the doors
to the barracks last night,

30:19.692 --> 30:21.528
countless innocent people died.

30:21.611 --> 30:24.656
If I had opened the gate,
the soldiers would have been in danger.

30:24.739 --> 30:26.491
Firing your arrow at me

30:26.574 --> 30:29.869
is punishable by death
and annihilation of your family.

30:29.953 --> 30:31.329
You have committed treason!

30:31.412 --> 30:34.249
[stuttering] By the way, who are you?

30:43.258 --> 30:47.512
[stuttering]
The four-clawed dragon... You are...

30:48.555 --> 30:50.640
It is an honor to greet the Crown Prince!

30:52.058 --> 30:53.726
- [crowd mumbling]
- [gasps]

30:55.186 --> 30:56.312
What did he just say?

30:56.396 --> 30:57.564
What are you doing?

30:57.647 --> 30:59.315
He is the Crown Prince!

30:59.941 --> 31:01.025
[crowd gasps]

31:05.905 --> 31:08.241
I should kill you right this instant,

31:09.242 --> 31:10.910
but we need all the help we can get, so...

31:10.994 --> 31:12.078
Please spare my life.

31:12.453 --> 31:14.664
I shall punish you
after resolving the situation.

31:16.499 --> 31:18.084
[whimpering]

31:20.003 --> 31:21.504
How many soldiers are still alive?

31:21.588 --> 31:24.090
- [whimpers]
- [stutters]

31:24.716 --> 31:25.967
Only 50, Your Royal Highness.

31:26.467 --> 31:29.512
- That is correct.
- Have every soldier search for bodies.

31:30.054 --> 31:32.265
They must burn them immediately.

31:32.348 --> 31:34.017
You cannot do that.

31:34.100 --> 31:36.895
I understand how you feel,
having lost your family.

31:37.478 --> 31:39.355
However, we must burn them
to avoid future harm.

31:39.439 --> 31:41.441
Light a signal fire and send messengers

31:41.524 --> 31:44.319
to spread the word and request support
so that we can quarantine Dongnae.

31:44.402 --> 31:47.780
And transport survivors
using boats on either quayside

31:48.656 --> 31:51.034
to safety before nightfall.

31:52.702 --> 31:54.746
Cho Beom-pal, the magistrate of Dongnae,

31:54.829 --> 31:57.332
- shall heed Your Royal Highness's command!
- [sobs]

31:57.415 --> 31:59.751
[crowd] We shall obey!

32:02.712 --> 32:04.589
[somber music playing]

32:24.192 --> 32:25.568
The signal fire has been lit!

32:34.035 --> 32:35.495
[urging horses]

32:42.001 --> 32:47.465
HANYANG

32:47.548 --> 32:50.426
- Where is the Chief Scholar?
- He is waiting inside.

32:52.845 --> 32:54.973
I came out of respect to him,

32:55.848 --> 32:58.476
but things are tense right now
with the talk of treason.

32:58.559 --> 33:02.271
It does not look good to meet
secretly like this.

33:03.314 --> 33:05.400
We have something urgent to tell you.

33:06.567 --> 33:07.652
This way, please.

33:08.361 --> 33:09.320
[clears throat]

33:14.534 --> 33:15.952
[man] What do you mean?

33:16.661 --> 33:19.080
Corpses were found in the King's palace?

33:19.998 --> 33:23.209
[man] Something strange is happening there
for sure.

33:24.502 --> 33:27.422
Lord Cho Hak-ju is hiding it from us.

33:28.548 --> 33:31.801
I know you are one of his men.

33:32.260 --> 33:34.971
However, I am telling you
because I believe you know

33:35.054 --> 33:36.514
what is right and wrong.

33:37.223 --> 33:38.266
[sighs]

33:40.435 --> 33:42.020
I cannot believe it.

33:43.396 --> 33:44.522
It cannot be.

33:46.315 --> 33:49.777
There is only one way
to find out the truth.

33:51.446 --> 33:53.031
Let us go to the King's palace.

33:53.364 --> 33:56.701
If we go and see His Majesty in person
and confirm that he is safe,

33:56.784 --> 33:58.536
everything will become clear.

33:59.537 --> 34:01.581
The Queen has forbidden
anyone from entering

34:02.165 --> 34:03.916
the King's palace.

34:04.000 --> 34:08.087
We serve His Majesty, not the Queen.

34:10.923 --> 34:13.718
Lord Ahn Hyeon will join us.

34:16.012 --> 34:18.473
Do you mean the Lord Ahn Hyeon?

34:20.099 --> 34:22.268
[chief scholar]
He is laying low in his hometown,

34:22.351 --> 34:25.188
mourning the loss of his mother
for three years,

34:25.271 --> 34:26.606
but if he takes action,

34:27.023 --> 34:31.778
all the scholars and subjects of the land
will follow him.

34:56.761 --> 34:58.763
[guard]
I was keeping an eye on Chief Scholar,

34:58.846 --> 35:01.933
and I found this after searching
his servant leaving in haste.

35:02.016 --> 35:04.393
It is a letter meant
for Lord Ahn Hyeon in Sangju.

35:04.477 --> 35:05.728
[chuckles]

35:07.271 --> 35:08.981
All he did was read books.

35:10.316 --> 35:11.734
If he wants to challenge me,

35:12.777 --> 35:14.821
he would need Lord Ahn Hyeon's help.

35:15.947 --> 35:16.948
What should we do?

35:18.866 --> 35:20.243
Leave them be.

35:20.326 --> 35:21.452
Are you sure?

35:21.536 --> 35:24.038
Lord Ahn Hyeon saved the nation
during the war three years ago.

35:24.122 --> 35:28.084
If he supports the Crown Prince,
the people may as well.

35:28.167 --> 35:29.335
Lord Ahn Hyeon...

35:31.170 --> 35:33.881
can never oppose me.

35:36.926 --> 35:38.427
No matter what.

35:41.055 --> 35:44.225
DONGNAE

35:45.476 --> 35:47.979
[soldier]
My lord, I have brought the criminal.

35:50.148 --> 35:51.065
Okay.

35:54.402 --> 35:55.278
Send her in.

36:00.616 --> 36:01.951
[door creaks]

36:03.661 --> 36:04.954
You wanted to see me?

36:06.706 --> 36:09.375
Yes. I called you here today because--

36:09.458 --> 36:10.751
[sobs]

36:10.835 --> 36:12.378
It is all my fault.

36:12.461 --> 36:14.338
I should have reported it right away,

36:14.839 --> 36:19.177
but they were like family to me,
so I thought I could cure them.

36:19.260 --> 36:20.511
Please kill me.

36:20.595 --> 36:21.679
[stammers] No...

36:23.514 --> 36:25.391
No. That is not it.

36:25.474 --> 36:29.770
Well, it is your duty as a physician
to cure people.

36:29.854 --> 36:32.565
That is not all.
You saved my life last night.

36:32.982 --> 36:34.233
You are too kind, my lord.

36:34.317 --> 36:36.485
- I merely--
- No.

36:37.778 --> 36:38.738
Well...

36:39.906 --> 36:40.990
I swear

36:41.991 --> 36:44.827
I will repay you for what you did.

36:46.579 --> 36:48.080
Until all the hair on my head...

36:49.916 --> 36:51.584
turns white,

36:53.377 --> 36:55.171
I will keep you by my side.

36:59.508 --> 37:01.636
Do you need a physician?

37:02.595 --> 37:04.680
Do you have an ailment, my lord?

37:05.973 --> 37:09.310
- No, that is not--
- You are flushed.

37:09.977 --> 37:12.104
Are you always like that?

37:12.772 --> 37:16.734
Or are you usually fine,
but get flushed when you are nervous?

37:16.817 --> 37:20.196
It may be
because your heart or liver is unhealthy.

37:20.821 --> 37:24.450
If you do not mind,
may I check your pulse?

37:25.034 --> 37:26.118
My pulse?

37:27.662 --> 37:28.621
[laughs]

37:29.747 --> 37:31.374
Men and women must be separated,

37:32.208 --> 37:34.627
but that is not a problem between us.

37:35.294 --> 37:39.340
Sure. Take your time and check my pulse.

37:48.391 --> 37:52.478
Do you have difficulty urinating?

37:52.561 --> 37:55.856
- Did you just say--
- Your lower abdomen may be strained.

37:56.649 --> 37:59.193
You may feel pain in your penis, too.

38:01.445 --> 38:04.031
My... penis?

38:04.115 --> 38:05.366
[laughing]

38:05.449 --> 38:06.492
I think...

38:08.244 --> 38:09.662
it is gonorrhea.

38:10.746 --> 38:11.998
Gonorrhea?

38:12.581 --> 38:14.500
What? My...

38:15.376 --> 38:17.211
Something is wrong with my thing?

38:17.295 --> 38:20.548
Do not worry. It is not that serious yet.

38:20.631 --> 38:23.342
You will be fine once you take medicine.

38:24.593 --> 38:28.097
[servant] My lord.
The Crown Prince's guard is here.

38:28.764 --> 38:30.141
Okay.

38:31.642 --> 38:32.560
Show him in.

38:37.148 --> 38:39.775
The Crown Prince ordered me
to bring that physician.

38:40.276 --> 38:42.820
Oh... I see.

38:43.237 --> 38:44.322
In that case...

38:45.364 --> 38:48.117
You should. Sure. Go ahead.

38:54.457 --> 38:56.459
[door creaks, closes]

38:59.837 --> 39:02.340
- My lord! This is the head clerk.
- Oh.

39:05.134 --> 39:07.803
Okay. What is it?

39:09.096 --> 39:10.014
[sighs]

39:10.598 --> 39:13.768
During last night's mayhem,
all of the battleships were destroyed.

39:13.851 --> 39:16.937
And there are not enough boats
to evacuate the people.

39:17.021 --> 39:20.066
- [sighs]
- There is one decent cargo ship,

39:20.983 --> 39:24.320
so it can set sail in about two hours.

39:24.403 --> 39:27.448
How can we evacuate all those people
with just one cargo ship?

39:27.531 --> 39:29.075
I know. That is...

39:29.533 --> 39:31.202
How is the search for bodies coming along?

39:32.620 --> 39:33.454
Hey.

39:34.288 --> 39:37.583
We made every soldier available
search for bodies,

39:38.125 --> 39:39.126
but it is to no avail.

39:40.419 --> 39:43.297
Then find as many as possible. Go!

39:46.550 --> 39:47.426
[sighs]

39:49.512 --> 39:51.514
Nothing is going right.

39:54.558 --> 39:55.726
No!

39:56.435 --> 39:59.688
- I am sorry, my lord.
- The Crown Prince gave us a command.

40:00.189 --> 40:01.232
[sighs]

40:02.483 --> 40:04.610
Come up with a plan before the sun sets.

40:23.671 --> 40:26.006
[ominous music playing]

40:26.090 --> 40:28.092
[liquid dripping]

40:45.985 --> 40:48.779
[growling]

40:50.656 --> 40:52.450
[shrieking]

40:53.242 --> 40:54.285
[snarling]

40:55.035 --> 40:55.953
Yeong-ju.

41:01.292 --> 41:03.043
- [bones cracking]
- [snarling]

41:14.346 --> 41:15.806
[gasps] Master!

41:17.766 --> 41:18.934
What is going on?

41:19.477 --> 41:20.728
It was not like this.

41:21.520 --> 41:22.605
In Hanyang...

41:23.647 --> 41:25.733
It was not like this in Hanyang.

41:25.816 --> 41:26.942
When Dan-i...

41:28.068 --> 41:29.028
When Dan-i...

41:30.029 --> 41:31.197
was bitten,

41:31.947 --> 41:35.576
he was sick for days
and died as a human being.

41:35.659 --> 41:37.244
[woman screams]

41:38.245 --> 41:39.330
But...

41:40.414 --> 41:41.749
when those people

41:43.042 --> 41:44.251
got bitten,

41:46.003 --> 41:47.838
they turned into the same monster.

41:48.339 --> 41:49.798
The disease has changed.

41:51.091 --> 41:52.676
It has begun to spread.

41:54.678 --> 41:57.264
What are you talking about, Master?

42:00.392 --> 42:02.061
- I can fix it.
- [creature shrieks]

42:02.144 --> 42:03.312
I can...

42:04.522 --> 42:05.981
fix this disease.

42:07.191 --> 42:10.528
I logged everything about the disease.
Everything...

42:11.320 --> 42:12.821
[groaning]

42:14.448 --> 42:16.200
[grunting]

42:23.832 --> 42:24.792
[thud]

42:31.340 --> 42:34.093
TWO HOURS AFTER STICKING A NEEDLE
COATED WITH CRUSHED RESURRECTION PLANT

42:34.176 --> 42:38.055
INTO HIS MAJESTY'S FOREHEAD,
HE CAME BACK TO LIFE

42:45.604 --> 42:47.273
This disease can be cured?

42:48.732 --> 42:49.817
Is that true?

42:50.234 --> 42:53.195
That is what he said.

42:55.447 --> 42:58.492
"The cold valley that is foggy
four seasons of the year.

42:58.576 --> 43:02.413
The plant with a purple flower
that blooms in early autumn

43:02.496 --> 43:06.041
will resurrect a person who has died."

43:07.876 --> 43:09.587
Did you go to the valley
to find that plant?

43:09.670 --> 43:11.797
I thought I could figure out a way

43:11.880 --> 43:16.135
to cure the diseased
if I found that plant, so I went there,

43:17.261 --> 43:19.346
but I could not find such a plant.

43:19.763 --> 43:22.933
For now, there is no way
to cure this disease.

43:23.934 --> 43:25.436
[approaching footsteps]

43:26.895 --> 43:29.982
[Mu-yeong] Your Royal Highness.
I need to tell you something.

43:40.284 --> 43:42.328
I cannot find Commander Cho's head.

43:42.786 --> 43:44.163
If someone took it

43:45.247 --> 43:47.082
- to Cho Hak-ju...
- [sighs]

43:47.166 --> 43:48.417
[sighs]

43:49.335 --> 43:50.836
This is utterly frustrating.

43:53.672 --> 43:56.258
You should have talked to him nicely.
Why did you do that?

43:56.925 --> 43:59.637
He is Cho Hak-ju's precious only son.

43:59.720 --> 44:02.139
If he receives that only son's
decapitated head,

44:02.973 --> 44:04.642
he will not forgive us.

44:04.725 --> 44:06.852
I will not forgive him either.

44:06.935 --> 44:07.811
Pardon?

44:09.688 --> 44:13.192
You were accused of treason
and fled all the way to Dongnae.

44:13.609 --> 44:15.653
How do you plan to fight him?

44:16.153 --> 44:17.738
I have a justification now.

44:19.031 --> 44:20.282
I must gather support.

44:20.366 --> 44:21.367
Justification?

44:22.785 --> 44:23.744
What justification?

44:28.999 --> 44:30.334
[king] Stay alive.

44:37.758 --> 44:39.218
You must stay alive.

44:46.725 --> 44:47.893
Father...

44:51.313 --> 44:52.398
has passed away.

44:55.776 --> 44:56.694
Pardon?

44:59.279 --> 45:00.906
His Majesty has passed away?

45:02.533 --> 45:04.034
Cho Hak-ju and the Queen

45:04.743 --> 45:06.829
used the resurrection plant on him

45:08.080 --> 45:09.498
after he passed away...

45:11.542 --> 45:13.001
to protect their authority.

45:18.132 --> 45:20.134
That journal and that female physician

45:20.926 --> 45:22.553
will testify to that fact.

45:26.098 --> 45:27.224
Sangju...

45:29.017 --> 45:30.602
I shall go to Lord Ahn Hyeon.

45:37.234 --> 45:38.694
Hurry up. Hurry.

45:41.488 --> 45:44.032
Just a minute.

45:44.116 --> 45:45.951
Hurry. Move quickly.

45:50.873 --> 45:51.832
Oh...

45:52.666 --> 45:54.668
Finish up before people flock here.

45:55.669 --> 45:56.587
Let us go.

45:56.670 --> 45:58.213
[pig oinks]

46:00.007 --> 46:01.675
Why is he bringing a pig?

46:06.221 --> 46:08.640
[soldier] The ship is leaving! Hurry!

46:09.141 --> 46:11.018
Everyone ran away! Hurry up!

46:11.101 --> 46:12.352
[retreating footsteps]

46:12.436 --> 46:13.854
[whimpering]

46:18.817 --> 46:21.278
Hey! Excuse me!

46:21.361 --> 46:22.905
Hey, what is going on?

46:22.988 --> 46:23.989
Take care of yourself!

46:29.703 --> 46:30.704
[grunts]

46:32.915 --> 46:33.874
[groans]

46:33.957 --> 46:35.542
[bird squawks]

46:39.379 --> 46:41.673
[Mu-yeong]
It is quicker by boat to Sangju.

46:41.757 --> 46:44.885
They are almost done fixing the ship,
so let us go to the dock.

46:44.968 --> 46:46.428
[bird squawks]

46:54.812 --> 46:56.730
[crowd clamoring]

47:02.402 --> 47:06.323
[woman] Oh, no!
Do not leave us, my lord! Please!

47:06.406 --> 47:08.367
Take us with you!

47:09.326 --> 47:11.411
[woman 2] Do not abandon us!

47:11.495 --> 47:14.581
[man] Please take us with you!

47:14.665 --> 47:16.041
My lord!

47:16.124 --> 47:19.419
- Please take our baby! Just our baby!
- [man 2] Please come back!

47:23.382 --> 47:24.716
[woman 3 sobbing] My lord!

47:25.509 --> 47:27.010
[man 3] Please take us!

47:30.889 --> 47:31.932
Why those...

47:32.015 --> 47:34.726
They should do something
instead of just whining.

47:34.810 --> 47:36.311
Why are they so foolish?

47:39.857 --> 47:42.025
Is it okay for us to do this?

47:42.609 --> 47:47.197
It is impossible to get rid of
all the corpses before the sun sets.

47:47.281 --> 47:49.908
It will be mayhem again at night.

47:49.992 --> 47:51.743
Staying there

47:51.827 --> 47:54.830
is like running into fire
carrying kindling.

47:56.206 --> 48:00.669
You and the noblemen
are the pillars that sustain Dongnae.

48:00.752 --> 48:01.920
- That is right.
- I agree.

48:02.004 --> 48:05.048
You must stay alive and rebuild Dongnae.

48:05.132 --> 48:06.091
[clears throat]

48:08.051 --> 48:08.969
[groans]

48:12.389 --> 48:15.642
You are positive that the Crown Prince
left Dongnae safely, right?

48:15.726 --> 48:17.477
Yes, of course.

48:17.561 --> 48:20.480
I saw the two of them leave
with my own eyes.

48:20.564 --> 48:22.816
You need not worry, my lord.

48:22.900 --> 48:25.444
Did he take that female physician
with him?

48:26.236 --> 48:27.154
Who?

48:27.779 --> 48:28.822
Oh...

48:28.906 --> 48:30.449
[stammers] Never mind.

48:31.575 --> 48:34.202
- [officer] Excuse me.
- Do not worry, and--

48:34.286 --> 48:35.287
- Hey.
- My lord.

48:37.331 --> 48:38.290
[chuckles]

48:45.714 --> 48:46.840
Will it be okay?

48:47.382 --> 48:49.217
The Crown Prince is still there.

48:49.927 --> 48:52.262
- [clears throat]
- If he finds out we left like this,

48:53.055 --> 48:54.264
he will have our heads.

48:55.557 --> 48:58.560
We shot arrows at the Crown Prince
last night.

48:59.144 --> 49:00.812
He said he would annihilate our families.

49:00.896 --> 49:03.106
We are dead either way.

49:04.691 --> 49:05.567
But...

49:06.485 --> 49:09.488
Okay. Good. Nice.

49:12.950 --> 49:14.076
[laughs]

49:15.077 --> 49:16.370
[sniffing]

49:26.129 --> 49:27.255
[sighs]

49:27.339 --> 49:28.632
Come on, now.

49:29.007 --> 49:30.634
Do not worry.

49:31.051 --> 49:33.929
The Cho Clan has control
over the Lees in this world.

49:34.012 --> 49:34.972
If we...

49:36.723 --> 49:40.644
stay on the magistrate's good side,
we will be able to find a way to survive.

49:41.186 --> 49:42.187
[chuckles]

49:43.814 --> 49:45.315
[oinks]

51:00.974 --> 51:02.976
[theme music playing]
